T1  - Valacyclovir and prednisolone treatment for Bell's palsy: a multicenter, randomized, placebo-controlled study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/01.mao.0000265190.29969.12
A1  - Hato, Naohito
A1  - Yamada, Hiroyuki
