T1  - Early treatment with prednisolone or acyclovir in Bell's palsy.
T3  - Comment in: N Engl J Med. 2007 Oct 18;357(16):1653-5 PMID: 17942879 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/17942879] Comment in: J Fam Pract. 2008 Jan;57(1):22-5 PMID: 18171565 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18171565] Comment in: N Engl J Med. 2008 Jan 17;358(3):306; author reply 307 PMID: 18199872 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18199872] Comment in: N Engl J Med. 2008 Jan 17;358(3):306-7; author reply 307 PMID: 18203330 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18203330] Comment in: N Engl J Med. 2008 Jan 17;358(3):306; author reply 307 PMID: 18203331 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18203331] Comment in: ACP J Club. 2008 Mar-Apr;148(2):29 PMID: 18311859 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18311859] Comment in: Evid Based Med. 2008 Apr;13(2):44 PMID: 18375697 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18375697]
