T1  - Protocol for German trial of Acyclovir and corticosteroids in Herpes-simplex-virus-encephalitis (GACHE): a multicenter, multinational, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled German, Austrian and Dutch trial [ISRCTN45122933].
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/1471-2377-8-40
A1  - Martinez-Torres, Francisco
